<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="3."><l>So I’ve no cause to frown as one who’s received this zoe.</l><l>I know life runs its course and triumphs inevitably.</l><l>I’m required just to stay in the flow,</l><l>If I do the drinking then God gives the growth.</l><l>So there’s joy in my heart, and a spring in my step,</l><l>And a smile on my face as I sing,</l><l>Oh, I’ve got rivers of life flowing out of my innermost being!</l><l>I’ve got rivers of life flowing out of my innermost being!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
